{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "27cc3aadcaab2d5fbc47fb2a7fa77ff1398fcc57e71e0836ac9a3ab5690be855", "ja": "亜利沙の場合：ありさとありさ", "zh": "亚利沙的情况：亚利沙与亚利沙", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e88abd454c75805f8da68fa8c115d065f6c4a2da29f1447be9e7b218bbdccfb3", "ja": "BOT公演がスタートし、撮影した写真も\n公開が始まる。亜利沙の写真は、アイドルの\n亜利沙を撮影するアイドルオタクの亜利沙が\n写る1枚。皆のおかげで両方がいてこその\n自分だと気づいたことを話すのだった。", "zh": "BOT公演正式开始，拍摄的照片也\n开始对外公开。亚利沙的照片，拍下的是\n偶像宅亚利沙正在为偶像亚利沙拍照的\n1张照片。她向大家倾诉，多亏了大家，\n自己才意识到正是两者兼具才成就了自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1000_kansei", "source_sha256": "d16bcdc59bd63ee59971d7832140beeeef5710eb231fcdc27bacc3bb83c275a2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアアアアアッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "274fe230d5a9c54b42551279630ac63ef8cd567f5e14daa858e3a00eda1fb8b6", "ja": "（今回のBOT公演もいよいよスタート！\nみんな、アンコールまでバッチリ決めてくれた！）", "zh": "（这次BOT公演也终于开始了！大家一直到安可都完美发挥！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "16da4342e57655516d84c3cc8dab3cca5f437f04df068a7f1646c86725c5634f", "ja": "まずは初回公演お疲れさま！\n観客席、おおいに盛り上がってたぞ！", "zh": "首场公演辛苦了！\n观众席的气氛非常热烈哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "d1d2115d7a1aae5968b9e7075f27b28392a6870169baebbcb4d205fc095b1e53", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nお昼時のうちの店もビックリな熱気でしたね！", "zh": "谢谢您♪\n那份狂热，连我们家店里的午饭高峰期都要甘拜下风呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "ea5c96dea12530376186e2703ea1aafbcd2b5ac8d30601f5d3080c3de4e8dbf9", "ja": "スタートダッシュ大成功！\nこのままみんなと千秋楽まで駆け抜けられそう！", "zh": "开场冲刺大成功！\n照这样下去，感觉能和大家一路冲到最终公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "93a5093eb9ba95e1e078065b10def18846f94aeead05b45e68318f9b2b251f09", "ja": "いい意気込みだ！　ただし、今回が\n『BATTLE OF THEATER』である事は忘れずにな。", "zh": "干劲很足嘛！不过，可别忘了\n这次是“BATTLE OF THEATER”啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "b4ee13961ac51208cb3bf2654926cc6be39c5883e67fa931a502cf3f10a5831e", "ja": "はい。姫君同士での大和撫子闘争、\n内容は写真対決です！", "zh": "是的。这次是公主们之间的大和抚子之争，内容是摄影对决！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "95fc2a24b432bef747347ee83ea7b174ad575382792950e5a838d38e5c0c761c", "ja": "テーマは『自分史上最高の瞬間！\n自己肯定感爆アゲな一枚♪』でしたね。", "zh": "主题是“自己人生中最棒的瞬间！让自我肯定感爆棚的一张照片♪”，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "ec8a408740708194511ff4286a0674ea4f50ee09a1bac5b4acba0a6ad7fdb648", "ja": "写真は今日から劇場の公式サイトと、\n劇場でもお客さんに公開するんですよね？", "zh": "照片从今天开始会在剧场官网和剧场内向客人公开，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4a84f69c1fbd304e1de868b1aa60fdd84a092ad89265de2e649854399d416822", "ja": "ああ。もう貼り出してある。\n今日からお客さん達も投票していってくれるだろう。", "zh": "嗯，已经贴出来了。\n从今天开始，观众们也会来投票吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "e476a91d872c4884ebc5147e037eaecc993f2ef0d3163fbfcad6f81415ce16ba", "ja": "あ、私まだ見てない写真あるかも。\n海美ちゃんと、エミリーちゃんと……。", "zh": "啊，说不定还有我没看过的照片。\n海美、艾米莉，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "7fef3afc548851bdd36cf3e87bf2c10fb029b63d3fde6e344136d509ba36c9ef", "ja": "私も！　見てても見てなくても、\n何度でもみんなの最高の一枚、見たいよ～！", "zh": "我也是！不管看没看过，我都想一次又一次地看看大家最棒的照片～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "735df70c870b750bc7cbb53d1372df26fc82df3ed966f7a1c30b30d2dd1969fe", "ja": "わかった。\n全員分の写真を用意しようか。", "zh": "明白了。\n那就把所有人的照片都准备好一份吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "79870cad662cae422ba493bbc0302397cfe261be72edd072b47ce09e28454b4a", "ja": "わあ、エミリーちゃん、かわいい！\n華やかな振袖が、とってもよく似合ってる……！", "zh": "哇，艾米莉，真可爱！\n这身华丽的振袖，非常适合你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "14757c90f65170a0abd7be160583cbf2bd5c39424474e65e4fbfc5b029631828", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\n美奈子さんの笑顔も、とっても素敵です！", "zh": "谢谢♪美奈子小姐的笑容也特别迷人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "a4ae7fae5dab99b83a8e4e27adda9aa943f4e0ba5680ddf4f37371c2ec64a5b3", "ja": "えへへ、上手に撮ってもらえたからね♪\n海美ちゃんは、躍動感いっぱい！", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为拍得很棒嘛♪\n海美的照片充满了动感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "fd89792c5f566d4801c8a669eff07cffd7ae072ae5af73bb48c14697f5cbde65", "ja": "うん！　達成の瞬間は気持ちよかったな～。\n……あれ？　ありりんの写真は……？", "zh": "嗯！达成目标的瞬间真是太痛快了～  \n……咦？亚莉琳的照片呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "3dfb3815e65c40dc34cded6b650a625869a3d396139cb409fe4386b3f2028efd", "ja": "あ、あります！　ついさっき撮れたばかりの\nもので……ど、どうぞ！　ご笑覧ください！", "zh": "啊，有、有的！这是刚才才拍下来的……请、请您欣赏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "c395f99202fb97cf38e0316523347517867c5da224c2976c2af4a9d596504ffa", "ja": "ありりんの一枚は……ステージの写真だー！！", "zh": "亚利沙的这一张是……舞台的照片啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "28c0e499a197346c1657201e6ac1eae12230c6c799981dfae62206471b0a150e", "ja": "そっか。これ、さっきのステージで、\nコーレスを盛り上げてたところだ！", "zh": "这样啊。这张是刚才的舞台上带动大家喊口号时拍的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "c4dc09c9749ec4bc5ddfc9f7d605abf05d05eab9c75d2cb20212e69f65ff673c", "ja": "うん、すごくいい一枚だと思う。\n……？　だけど、この角度は客席から……？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得是一张很棒的照片。\n……？　不过，这个角度是从观众席……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "1b19fd0def4312082351f066868b14d7ae1028626d9f955e21c4367b66666fee", "ja": "まるで、亜利沙がいつもアイドルを\n応援してる時の視点、みたいな……？", "zh": "简直就像是亜利沙平时为偶像加油时的视角……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "2b70735fb76744347cbb8958d51c59e1785361ded1f54bae253baceb1ac03912", "ja": "本当だ。そうなると、写真に写ってるのも\n亜利沙ちゃんで、撮ってるのも亜利沙ちゃん……？", "zh": "真的。这样一来，照片里的是亚利沙，拍照的也是亚利沙……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "337a0af6db88956c10c7d5e72db4d73d3d47c21abdce941dc7e2bf0fb90c1a4d", "ja": "実は、加工させてもらったんです。\nこれは二枚の写真の合体技なんです。", "zh": "其实是做了后期处理的。\n这是两张照片合体的绝招呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "3df5f01c92efc98ec4d344a8bd9d62bddc3a1efcc9f6707f4dc6359858f6dfdb", "ja": "二枚の写真の合体技？", "zh": "两张照片的合体技？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "1c7df44e016e587399e50c31b3d9bc7ee477d50917e4b9bc4922e6caccf6345b", "ja": "はい。ありさが客席側からアイドルちゃんを\n撮っている時の写真と……。", "zh": "是的。就是用亚利沙从观众席拍摄偶像们时的照片，和……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "d00304a50455db992c58073454f7e54bd3bd394cd9f8b662b98333467660b827", "ja": "{$P$}さんにアイドルのありさを\n撮ってもらった写真の、合体技です。", "zh": "这是让{$P$}先生拍摄偶像亚利沙的照片，和从观众席拍摄偶像亚利沙的照片的合体技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "5c1f4b95477ebe660b2da7eb57148708f10a0a2e0ca13f3d0c72c2f25839ab10", "ja": "客席にいるありさが、アイドルのありさを\n撮っている写真にしたかったので……。", "zh": "因为亚利沙想做成观众席里的亚利沙\n在拍作为偶像的亚利沙的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "82ccd360cb78c2a33412f1a781bc95d8f6e15881751a38a26f241e329874d65b", "ja": "じゃあアイドルのありりんと、アイドルを応援してる\nありりんの両方の表現なんだ！　面白ーい！", "zh": "所以，这是同时表现偶像亚利琳和为偶像加油的亚利琳吗！好有意思——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "b2104d3206fdb2e0d34dc86d2d7cec1eaa1e1771400174e14355027d57829677", "ja": "Wow！　なんと柔軟で画期的な発想でしょう……！\nなによりとても、亜利沙さんらしいです！", "zh": "哇！多么灵活又具有开创性的想法啊……！\n而且最重要的是，非常有亚利沙小姐的风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "635d1ced4212cc143e19ea1b4e1e4911dbad91c4768e6ced78a8ef83eb32d88b", "ja": "そ、そんなに褒めてもらうようなことでは！\n撮影は{$P$}さんですし……。", "zh": "没、没必要这样夸我啦！\n拍摄的是{$P$}先生，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "b003c0afbf147cf88d6d380268bdf8c23f2d659284c25464d09b353661ce1277", "ja": "それに、みなさんのおかげで思いついたようなもの\nですから。特に、エミリーちゃんのおかげです！", "zh": "而且，这也是托大家的福才想到的。\n尤其是多亏了艾米莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "f9ea9b50de1666856cdc5697985c76b516530382fc4141010943fda56d8fcee9", "ja": "え？　私、ですか？", "zh": "诶？是我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "8eccfd4662ef33ca9f4483a97f9f446941109c5cf2e2712b264abb5690ce881c", "ja": "どちらか一方が大切なのではなく、両方を大切に、\n愛していく……。あの言葉が決め手になりました。", "zh": "不是只重视其中一方，而是要珍惜双方，去爱着它们……那句话成了决定性的因素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "19000292952e52c71c263c636bbad22df4614a22cd99a94c14977409e45e9596", "ja": "あっ。浅草の呉服屋さんでの……？", "zh": "啊。是在浅草的和服店里的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "06e4951bf0e2f96008ca2b4f7fbb9fef1b340ccab99cd9d115b00151cace01f7", "ja": "ありさも同じなんです。アイドルオタクのありさ、\nアイドルのありさ。両方いてありさです。", "zh": "亚利沙也是一样的。既是偶像宅的亚利沙，\n又是身为偶像的亚利沙。两者兼具才是亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "701b78debc66534d6a13388e95aa4e9aa4d23fe663b3d3f8676b6dced4043c5d", "ja": "どっちかだけになってしまっては、ありさでは\nありません。……いられない、と言いますか……。", "zh": "要是只剩下其中一面，就不是有利纱了。……该说是，没法只剩下一面吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "73bf48a2456ce5388924949fbab7dd21a53324ea70a8e5a432f61d6d6cf29860", "ja": "両方とも同じくらいに、大好きなので！", "zh": "因为两边我都一样喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "a71cc0920e6c558be8ad9418ba01acb843f278230b1b07b9f3904891df1c6e82", "ja": "（みんな、自己分析と自己肯定感を踏まえて、\nどの写真も甲乙つけがたいものが揃ったな……）", "zh": "（大家结合自我分析和自我肯定，拍出的每张照片都各有千秋，实在难分高下啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0422_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_06_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a7f3dc8960673d2324231b670bb97c7580ec92a2f3c94e608802a8779ce76fa2", "ja": "（みんなのきらめきが詰まった爆アゲな写真たち。\n公演とともに多くの人に届くだろう！）", "zh": "（这些照片里满载着大家的闪耀，简直让人嗨到爆。一定能随着演出传达到许多人那里吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
